          <td data-label="Tip">Aim for a safe reserve before leaving</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Item"><strong>Commitments</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Question">What loans and family needs continue?</td>
          <td data-label="Tip">Reduce where possible</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Item"><strong>Benefits</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Question">What insurance or benefits will you lose?</td>
          <td data-label="Tip">Plan replacements</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Item"><strong>Notice and terms</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Question">What does your contract require?</td>
          <td data-label="Tip">Read it fully</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 id="lcplan">A twelve-week test plan</h2>

